<title>UK: MSI sets call warrants on Volvo.</title>
<headline>MSI sets call warrants on Volvo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd has issued a total of five million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on shares of AB Volvo, lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   17.SEP.98		 PAYDATE	17.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  190 SEK						  *</p>
<p>* * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	STRIKE	ISSUE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	 190 SEK     30.0 SEK   15.79 PCT    6.33 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	 200 SEK     26.0 SEK   18.95 PCT    7.31 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
